            "show_faq": true,
            "title_faq1": "Where do I select Shop Pay Installments?",
            "copy_faq1": "<p>At checkout, choose Shop Pay as your payment method, then select \"Pay in full or in installments\" in the Payment section.</p>",
            "title_faq2": "Why don't I see installments for Shop Pay?",
            "copy_faq2": "<p>Eligibility depends on the purchase amount, your card or bank, and Shop Pay's approval rules. If installments aren't showing, try another card, choose Affirm \"Pay Over Time\" instead, or pay in full.</p>",
            "title_faq3": "Is Shop Pay Installments the same as Affirm?",
            "copy_faq3": "<p>No. They're separate options with separate approvals. Getting approved for one doesn't guarantee approval for the other, so if Shop Pay Installments doesn't work, try Affirm at checkout.</p>",
            "title_faq4": "Need an invoice, purchase order, wire/ACH, or a business quote?",
